BLdzQ&oe=69B54C32"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "cover.png", "id": "997322675508817", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974685_997322685508816_924110274691852915_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8sIY4PiQGdYQ7kNvwEdomp5&_nc_oc=Adm6VIPoX9xqPQwCiV3gO-Mpe9CW0kwuvFkHgV1I5NID4UcGoZIzf2JI3fkgeDr1Umg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwB1vB2v_J-ykFlUfeEMFOwRRK1vtRb2nw0JZCDygpuXQ&oe=69B57060"}, "display_name": "Blade and Bullet", "keywords": [], "long_description": "In the heart of a neon-lit metropolis, where the lines between the ancient and the futuristic blur, chaos reigns. The city of Neo-Shinobi is under siege by powerful criminal syndicates and rogue AI. As the last surviving member of an ancient ninja clan, you are thrust into a battle for survival and justice. Armed with a katana and a high-tech gun, your mission in \"Blade and Bullet\" is to defend the city from relentless assaults and restore peace to Neo-Shinobi.\nKey Features\n\n1. Immersive VR Experience\n\n    Dive into the neon-drenched streets of Neo-Shinobi with stunning VR visuals. The high-fidelity graphics and realistic soundscapes create an unparalleled sense of immersion, making you feel as if you are truly in the midst of a cyberpunk dystopia.", "short_description": "Storyline\n\nIn the heart of a neon-lit metropolis, where the lines between the ancient and the futuristic blur, chaos reigns. The city of Neo-Shinobi is under siege by powerful criminal syndicates and rogue AI. As the last surviving member of an ancient ninja clan, you are thrust into a battle for survival and justice. Armed with a katana and a high-tech gun, your mission in \"Blade and Bullet\" is to defend the city from relentless assaults and restore peace to Neo-Shinobi.\nKey Features\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/blade-and-bullet/privacy-policy", "developer_term